{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐洲開源辦公軟件項目Euro-Office正式將業務擴展至桌面平台，推出面向Windows、macOS和Linux的獨立應用程式。此前，這套辦公軟件主要通過瀏覽器運行，此次桌面版的推出意味着用户可以像使用傳統Microsoft Office或LibreOffice一樣，在本地計算機上編輯文檔、電子表格和演示文稿。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586306.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:25:15.719997+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T17:05:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:22.709628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:22.709628+00:00","content_hash":"d62483d3a7d7f7bb46e2b548934ce94603d81482176ffa80545aaa631c824285","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}